      "text": "From initial concepts to finished creative assets, the fal ChatGPT plugin brings image and video generation directly into your conversations.\n\nGenerate, edit, and iterate with GPT Image 2.6, FLUX 3 Max, and other leading models without leaving ChatGPT.\n\nInstall the fal plugin:",
      "url": "https://x.com/fal/status/2120580152195465558"
    },
    {
      "attachments": {
        "media_keys": [
          "3_2120580091113816064"
        ]
      },
      "author_id": "39622874",
